+<div id="checking-for-batch-effects-1" class="section level2">
+<h2>Checking for batch effects</h2>
+<p>Color by metadata, like plate barcode, to check for batch effects.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiYGBgclxuVFNORVBsb3Qob2JqZWN0ID0gc3VidGlzcywgZG8ucmV0dXJuID0gVFJVRSwgZ3JvdXAuYnkgPSBcImNoYW5uZWxcIilcbmBgYCJ9 -->
+<pre class="r"><code>TSNEPlot(object = subtiss, do.return = TRUE, group.by = &quot;channel&quot;)</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-plot-begin eyJjb25kaXRpb25zIjpbXSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo0MTQuNzA5NSwic2l6ZV9iZWhhdmlvciI6MCwid2lkdGgiOjY3MX0= -->
+<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>
+<!-- rnb-plot-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>Print a table showing the count of cells in each identity category from each plate.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiYGBgclxudGFibGUoYXMuY2hhcmFjdGVyKHN1YnRpc3NAaWRlbnQpLCBhcy5jaGFyYWN0ZXIoc3VidGlzc0BtZXRhLmRhdGEkY2hhbm5lbCkpXG5gYGAifQ== -->
+<pre class="r"><code>table(as.character(subtiss@ident), as.character(subtiss@meta.data$channel))</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-output-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiICAgXG4gICAgMTBYX1A3XzRcbiAgMCAgICAgICA0OVxuICAxICAgICAgIDM4XG4ifQ== -->
