+<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>
+<!-- rnb-plot-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>Choose the number of principal components to use.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiYGBgclxuIyBTZXQgbnVtYmVyIG9mIHByaW5jaXBhbCBjb21wb25lbnRzLiBcbm4ucGNzID0gMTBcbmBgYCJ9 -->
+<pre class="r"><code># Set number of principal components. 
+n.pcs = 10</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>The clustering is performed based on a nearest neighbors graph. Cells that have similar expression will be joined together. The Louvain algorithm looks for groups of cells with high modularity–more connections within the group than between groups. The resolution parameter determines the scale…higher resolution will give more clusters, lower resolution will give fewer.</p>
+<p>For the top-level clustering, aim to under-cluster instead of over-cluster. It will be easy to subset groups and further analyze them below.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiYGBgclxuIyBTZXQgcmVzb2x1dGlvbiBcbnJlcy51c2VkIDwtIDAuNVxudGlzcyA8LSBGaW5kQ2x1c3RlcnMob2JqZWN0ID0gdGlzcywgcmVkdWN0aW9uLnR5cGUgPSBcInBjYVwiLCBkaW1zLnVzZSA9IDE6bi5wY3MsIFxuICAgIHJlc29sdXRpb24gPSByZXMudXNlZCwgcHJpbnQub3V0cHV0ID0gMCwgc2F2ZS5TTk4gPSBUUlVFKVxuYGBgIn0= -->
+<pre class="r"><code># Set resolution 
+res.used &lt;- 0.5
+tiss &lt;- FindClusters(object = tiss, reduction.type = &quot;pca&quot;, dims.use = 1:n.pcs, 
+    resolution = res.used, print.output = 0, save.SNN = TRUE)</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>To visualize</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin  -->
+<pre class="r"><code># If cells are too spread out, you can raise the perplexity. If you have few cells, try a lower perplexity (but never less than 10).
+tiss &lt;- RunTSNE(object = tiss, dims.use = 1:n.pcs, seed.use = 10, perplexity=30)</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-source-begin eyJkYXRhIjoiYGBgclxuIyBub3RlIHRoYXQgeW91IGNhbiBzZXQgZG8ubGFiZWw9VCB0byBoZWxwIGxhYmVsIGluZGl2aWR1YWwgY2x1c3RlcnNcblRTTkVQbG90KG9iamVjdCA9IHRpc3MsIGRvLmxhYmVsID0gVClcbmBgYCJ9 -->
+<pre class="r"><code># note that you can set do.label=T to help label individual clusters
+TSNEPlot(object = tiss, do.label = T)</code></pre>
+<!-- rnb-source-end -->
+<!-- rnb-plot-begin eyJjb25kaXRpb25zIjpbXSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo0MTQuNzA5NSwic2l6ZV9iZWhhdmlvciI6MCwid2lkdGgiOjY3MX0= -->
+<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>
+<!-- rnb-plot-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>Check expression of genes of interset.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-plot-begin eyJjb25kaXRpb25zIjpbXSwiaGVpZ2h0IjoxMiwic2l6ZV9iZWhhdmlvciI6MSwid2lkdGgiOjh9 -->
+<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>
+<!-- rnb-plot-end -->
+<!-- rnb-plot-begin eyJjb25kaXRpb25zIjpbXSwiaGVpZ2h0IjoxMiwic2l6ZV9iZWhhdmlvciI6MSwid2lkdGgiOjh9 -->
+<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>
+<!-- rnb-plot-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
+<p>Dotplots let you see the intensity of exppression and the fraction of cells expressing for each of your genes of interest.</p>
+<!-- rnb-text-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-begin -->
+<!-- rnb-plot-begin eyJjb25kaXRpb25zIjpbXSwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo0LCJzaXplX2JlaGF2aW9yIjoxLCJ3aWR0aCI6OH0= -->
+<p><img src="data:image/png;base64," /></p>
+<!-- rnb-plot-end -->
+<!-- rnb-chunk-end -->
+<!-- rnb-text-begin -->
